            "review_text": "Hrothmir\nSmyrna, GA333 contributions\n0\nGreat ban xeo (crispy pancake) meal. Would definitely return here. Worth effort to find.\nFeb 2026 • Friends\nMy friend and I wanted to try banh xeo, a crispy pancake with shrimp and other ingredients inside. We were at the northeast corner of Hoan Kiem lake (centrally located). Asking around for banh xeo, we were directed to this restaurant. It was a little hard to find - via a couple alleys off P Cao Go.\n\nWhen we arrived, we noticed that none of the diners looked like locals - a bit of a disappointment. Also, the menu prices seemed a little higher than normal - again a disappointment. But then the food came out. In addition to your entree, you get complimentary soup and side dishes - making the meal a great value. The Bahn xeo was delicious. My friend and I both gave our meal here a very high rating.\n\nAs others here note, the proprietor seems to have an interest in supporting street children; so you meal may support a good cause too.\n\nI would definitely return here if back in Hanoi.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten February 26, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
